        "base": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/feed/",
        "language": null,
        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_9 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_9\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_9  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_9  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re aware of an outage impacting the Northland region.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The root cause has been identified as a fibre cut and Chorus technicians are currently preparing to undertake the remediation work.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Current estimated resolution time is 11:30pm, Tuesday 16 June.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019ll provide more updates when we can.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Update 5:30pm:</strong> We believe this issue has now been resolved and service has been restored. If you&#8217;re still experiencing issues, please contact our Customer Support team on 0800 532 764.</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/outage-impacting-the-northland-region/\">Outage impacting the Northland region</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
      }
